{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/e6687bbed3cdc6f542ce8abd2ebfe003.avif?t=1764105201\" width=1214 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liturge is a co-op horror game for 1\u20134 players, where your only goal is to perform a ritual to banish the ghost and find the way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a game about fear, darkness, and desperation - where every step can bring you closer to salvation\u2026 or death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>R I T U A L S</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the game are rituals. They are the only way to banish the entity haunting the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complete the rite, you must gather ritual items and discover the correct sequence of steps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is handed to you - every playthrough requires piecing the rules together anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake can immediately trigger a hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>N O T E S\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the map are notes containing fragments of instructions needed to complete the ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some hint at which items are required, others reveal the place where the ritual must be performed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s up to the players to connect the pieces and understand how to banish the ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>L I G H T \u00a0 A N D \u00a0 D A R K N E S S</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is the key to safety. The generator and lamps protect players from the dark and prevent the loss of sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the lights go out, the tension rises - the ghost draws nearer, and every step in the shadows increases the risk of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing light is one of the most important aspects of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>T H E \u00a0 G H O S T</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ghost is never a passive opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It observes, manipulates the environment, sometimes gives subtle signs of its presence, and sometimes begins to hunt without warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter with it blurs the line between reality and nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>T H E \u00a0 E S C A P E</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a correctly performed ritual opens the way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the final step that ends the nightmare and gives the players a chance to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liturge is a horror game that blends tension, exploration, and rituals. Waiting won\u2019t save you. Hiding won\u2019t protect you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must uncover the truth, gather the items, and perform the ritual - before the darkness consumes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3977630?t=1764105201","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3977630?t=1764105201","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/e3ebee896ec3b2cfe5374222d3ce4ce113a4b0af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764105201","capsule_imagev5":