_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the map are notes containing fragments of instructions needed to complete the ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some hint at which items are required, others reveal the place where the ritual must be performed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s up to the players to connect the pieces and understand how to banish the ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>L I G H T \u00a0 A N D \u00a0 D A R K N E S S</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is the key to safety. The generator and lamps protect players from the dark and prevent the loss of sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the lights go out, the tension rises - the ghost draws nearer, and every step in the shadows increases the risk of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing light is one of the most important aspects of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>T H E \u00a0 G H O S T</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ghost is never a passive opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It observes, manipulates the environment, sometimes gives subtle signs of its presence, and sometimes begins to hunt without warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter with it blurs the line between reality and nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>T H E \u00a0 E S C A P E</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a correctly performed ritual opens the way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the final step that ends the nightmare and gives the players a chance to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liturge is a horror game that blends tension, exploration, and rituals. Waiting won\u2019t save you. Hiding won\u2019t protect you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must uncover the truth, gather the items, and perform the ritual - before the darkness consumes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["No Cry Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/06241b71d861798de797d18872b349bd169d2adb/header.jpg?t=1764105201","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Liturge\u2122 \u00a9 2025 No Cry Studio. ","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3977630/498449024/88c1a3aa2451e71c7bacd3e0de1f74421bfbbfb6/1764004006/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764005241","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3977630/498449024/88c1a3aa2451e71c7bacd3e0de1f74421bfbbfb6/1764004006/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764005241","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3977630/498449024/88c1a3aa2451e71c7bacd3e0de1f74421bfbbfb6/1764004006/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764005241","id":257237197,"name":"Liturge - OUT NOW ON STEAM","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257237197/be38d6e9d57270f5900832f6790ffc7a4ba7d4bf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764005241"}],"name":"Liturge","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Liturge - $6.99 USD","packageid"